1
00:00:03,171 --> 00:00:07,073
To add a customer you deal with outside the site, such as someone

2
00:00:07,073 --> 00:00:09,601
who orders by phone, click Add customer.

3
00:00:10,053 --> 00:00:14,689
Choose the Kind, Person or Business, and type the first and last name.

4
00:00:14,689 --> 00:00:18,044
The Display name is how the store addresses them.

5
00:00:18,044 --> 00:00:20,423
Leave it empty to use their name.

6
00:00:20,877 --> 00:00:24,040
A business also has a Company and a Tax id.

7
00:00:24,040 --> 00:00:28,235
Tick Exempt from tax for a reseller or a charity you hold a

8
00:00:28,235 --> 00:00:31,591
certificate for, and note Why they are exempt.

9
00:00:31,591 --> 00:00:35,141
When they check out signed in, no tax is charged.

10
00:00:35,141 --> 00:00:37,077
A guest is always taxed.

11
00:00:37,528 --> 00:00:40,766
Add an Email and a Phone so you can reach them.

12
00:00:40,766 --> 00:00:45,044
Tick Accepts marketing only when they agreed to news and offers.

13
00:00:45,044 --> 00:00:48,038
Order and payment messages are always sent.

14
00:00:48,490 --> 00:00:49,469
Click Save.

15
00:00:49,469 --> 00:00:54,937
The customer opens with their Orders, Store credit, Addresses and Privacy sections below.

16
00:00:54,937 --> 00:01:00,463
The Status field lets you mark a customer Disabled when you stop doing business with them.

17
00:01:00,463 --> 00:01:02,190
They keep their history.

